00:13:35.180 --> 00:13:39.980
like to purposely practice being able to answer questions

00:13:39.980 --> 00:13:41.260
while I'm distracted.

00:13:43.260 --> 00:13:44.340
Okay.

00:13:44.340 --> 00:13:46.240
To see, just like to stretch my brain,

00:13:46.360 --> 00:13:47.580
as an exercise.

